{
    "title": "Comun: Tu banca moderna en USA",
    "description": "$0 FEE: Send money to family and friends abroad with Comun and get your first remittance transfer fee-free!\u00b3 \r\n\r\nWhen you open your Comun account you gain access to a comprehensive suite of financial tools, including a Visa\u00ae debit card, a banking account with funds insured by the FDIC\u00b9, and a user-friendly mobile app for effortless money management.\r\n\r\nComun is also the premier solution for sending money securely and swiftly to loved ones abroad. To ensure peace of mind, Comun provides real-time notifications from the moment you send the money until it's picked up. This way, you'll always know precisely when your money is safe with your recipient.\r\n\r\nOpen an account in minutes:\r\n-We accept more than 100 ID\u2019S from countries in LATAM including: passport, ID card, drivers license, residence card, VISA, and more\u00b2\r\n-Comun never asks for migratory status\r\n-Verify your residential address using the geolocation on your phone\r\n-No account opening fees, minimum balance charges, or monthly commissions\r\n-Deposit cash at over 88,000 locations across the country\r\n-Connect easily to apps like Zelle, CashApp, or Venmo\r\n-Connect your paycheck and get paid up to 2 days in advance with no fees\u2074\r\n-Talk with support in your time and your language with chat, email, or phone\r\n\r\nSafe, secure, fast international transfers:\r\n-Multiple levels of security designed to keep you protected\r\n-Comun Guarantee\u00ae on all transfers\r\n-Instant notifications from as soon as the money leaves your account to when it arrives in the hands of your recipient\r\n-Have questions? Get quick support in our Help Center in your language\r\n\r\n\r\nHow to open an account\r\n1. Download the app\r\n2. Apply\r\n3. Ready!\r\nDon\u2019t forget, as soon as you\u2019re approved, your first remittance transfer is fee-free!\u00b3\r\n\r\nBacked by Community Federal Savings Bank; Member FDIC.\r\nVisa Zero Liability Coverage against unauthorized charges.\r\nThe funds in your account are FDIC insured up to $250,000.\r\n\r\n\u00b9Deposits are insured up to $250,000 by the FDIC through Community Federal Savings Bank; Member FDIC.\r\n\u00b2Results may vary. For a complete list of eligible IDs and application requirements, follow this link: https://bit.ly/43wXOW7\r\n\u00b3Terms and conditions here: https://bit.ly/4eBO16r. Terms and conditions apply. Servicio UniTeller, Inc. is licensed in every state that requires a license. Comun, Inc. and/or Servicio UniTeller, Inc. may earn revenue on foreign exchange currency conversion. Fees are subject to change. Servicio UniTeller, Inc. and/or Comun, Inc. reserve the right, at any time, without prior notice, to add, modify, or terminate any and/or all of the terms of the promotion, or to replace, wholly or in part, the promotion with another offer with no liability to Servicio UniTeller, Inc. and/or Comun, Inc.\r\n\u2074Early access to direct deposit funds depends on the timing of the submission of the payment file from the payer. We generally make these funds available on the day the payment file is received, which may be up to two days earlier than the scheduled payment date. However, this availability is not guaranteed.\r\n\u2075Delivery times may vary. \r\n\r\nComun is a financial technology company and not a bank. The banking services offered by Comun are provided by Community Federal Savings Bank; Member FDIC. The Comun Visa\u00ae Debit Card is issued by Community Federal Savings Bank, licensed through Visa USA Inc. and can be used at any Visa acceptance point.",
    "descriptionHTML": "$0 FEE: Send money to family and friends abroad with Comun and get your first remittance transfer fee-free!\u00b3 <br><br>When you open your Comun account you gain access to a comprehensive suite of financial tools, including a Visa\u00ae debit card, a banking account with funds insured by the FDIC\u00b9, and a user-friendly mobile app for effortless money management.<br><br>Comun is also the premier solution for sending money securely and swiftly to loved ones abroad. To ensure peace of mind, Comun provides real-time notifications from the moment you send the money until it&#39;s picked up. This way, you&#39;ll always know precisely when your money is safe with your recipient.<br><br>Open an account in minutes:<br>-We accept more than 100 ID\u2019S from countries in LATAM including: passport, ID card, drivers license, residence card, VISA, and more\u00b2<br>-Comun never asks for migratory status<br>-Verify your residential address using the geolocation on your phone<br>-No account opening fees, minimum balance charges, or monthly commissions<br>-Deposit cash at over 88,000 locations across the country<br>-Connect easily to apps like Zelle, CashApp, or Venmo<br>-Connect your paycheck and get paid up to 2 days in advance with no fees\u2074<br>-Talk with support in your time and your language with chat, email, or phone<br><br>Safe, secure, fast international transfers:<br>-Multiple levels of security designed to keep you protected<br>-Comun Guarantee\u00ae on all transfers<br>-Instant notifications from as soon as the money leaves your account to when it arrives in the hands of your recipient<br>-Have questions? Get quick support in our Help Center in your language<br><br><br>How to open an account<br>1. Download the app<br>2. Apply<br>3. Ready!<br>Don\u2019t forget, as soon as you\u2019re approved, your first remittance transfer is fee-free!\u00b3<br><br>Backed by Community Federal Savings Bank; Member FDIC.<br>Visa Zero Liability Coverage against unauthorized charges.<br>The funds in your account are FDIC insured up to $250,000.<br><br>\u00b9Deposits are insured up to $250,000 by the FDIC through Community Federal Savings Bank; Member FDIC.<br>\u00b2Results may vary. For a complete list of eligible IDs and application requirements, follow this link: https://bit.ly/43wXOW7<br>\u00b3Terms and conditions here: https://bit.ly/4eBO16r. Terms and conditions apply. Servicio UniTeller, Inc. is licensed in every state that requires a license. Comun, Inc. and/or Servicio UniTeller, Inc. may earn revenue on foreign exchange currency conversion. Fees are subject to change. Servicio UniTeller, Inc. and/or Comun, Inc. reserve the right, at any time, without prior notice, to add, modify, or terminate any and/or all of the terms of the promotion, or to replace, wholly or in part, the promotion with another offer with no liability to Servicio UniTeller, Inc. and/or Comun, Inc.<br>\u2074Early access to direct deposit funds depends on the timing of the submission of the payment file from the payer. We generally make these funds available on the day the payment file is received, which may be up to two days earlier than the scheduled payment date. However, this availability is not guaranteed.<br>\u2075Delivery times may vary. <br><br>Comun is a financial technology company and not a bank. The banking services offered by Comun are provided by Community Federal Savings Bank; Member FDIC. The Comun Visa\u00ae Debit Card is issued by Community Federal Savings Bank, licensed through Visa USA Inc. and can be used at any Visa acceptance point.",
